# ztOSCoreSensorFramework: every piece of hardware support this system brings
# itself. kind|id|argument|title, in the order they are started.
#
#   module   a kernel module with no service of its own (id: its name in
#            /sys/module; argument: what modprobe is given)
#   unit     a systemd unit that keeps its own process alive
#   session  a program of the user's session: watched, not started
module|zrn_led|zrn-led|Notification light
module|zrn_haptic|zrn-haptic|Vibration motor
module|zrn_hotplug|zrn-hotplug|Core power
unit|ztoscirrusaudio.service||ztOSCirrusAudio
unit|ztoscsf-sensorhub.service||ztOSCoreSensorFramework: sensor hub
unit|ztoscsf-sensord.service||ztOSCoreSensorFramework: sensors
unit|ztoscorenetworking-modem.service||ztOSCoreNetworking: modem
unit|ztoscorenetworking.service||ztOSCoreNetworking: calls, messages, data
unit|zrnperfd.service||Performance
session|ztapps||App list
